          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fc5">Can I schedule a time for cattle treatment?</button></h2><div id="fc5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqCattle"><div class="accordion-body">Yes, you can schedule the day and time for cattle treatment without any stress.</div></div></div>
          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fc6">Will I receive the timely notifications on the cattle trading app?</button></h2><div id="fc6" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqCattle"><div class="accordion-body">Yes, you will get the timely notifications on the cattle trading app.</div></div></div>
